Audit complete: **FAIL / NOT_LEGIT**.

Although the clean target proof reaches `#Top` and is non-vacuous, the fused generator semantics rule is unsound over its declared domain. A trusted-translator witness raises `AttributeError` in Python while K returns—and proves—`BoolVal(true)`.

See the full [REVIEW.md](/audit-output/REVIEW.md) and preserved [evidence](/audit-output/evidence/).
